{"tmdb":1439698,"tagline":"","synopsis":"Dorian Gray is but a boy, yet he's worshipped as a God - by the closeted painter who immortalized his beauty, by the libertine who taught him all of the world's secret pleasures, and by himself. For the next one hundred years, Dorian Gray falls into a rabbit-hole of debauchery, remaining forever young while his portrait pays the price for each of his sins. But when crimes of decades past come back to haunt him, and the novelty of everlasting youth starts taking its toll, can his soul still be redeemed?","directors":[{"name":"Matheus Marchetti","id":2184977}],"cast":[{"actor":"Rodrigo Cavalini","role":"Dorian Gray","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/km7twTwKB4KZ0uGEAaXpb4350LH.jpg","tmdb":4157018},{"actor":"Johnny Hooker","role":"Henry Wotton (Act One)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/bpm7tsTNy7Qi0aesLWU8th3N2ZN.jpg","tmdb":1666020},{"actor":"Nuno Marchezi","role":"Basil Hallward (Act One)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/mdICVSBAPTVTTxBCuXBC1hWRIa5.jpg","tmdb":5268717},{"actor":"Tony Germano","role":"Henry Wotton (Act Two) / Old Faust","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/fCqWR4yfNglGDnDI0NZj2lVd97W.jpg","tmdb":2721636},{"actor":"Gabriel Muglia","role":"Basil Hallward (Act Two)","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/sBYqEYb6jZ3pLtY4WPUouptRa0M.jpg","tmdb":2315813},{"actor":"Yelon Daniel","role":"Antinous / Narcissus","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/nSP2IA0cF9lrvIxP7y5pjslin6t.jpg","tmdb":5268718},{"actor":"Andy Cruz","role":"Sibyl Vane","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/h6f6o5iRG5jHxXIppDbVtxHTmL9.jpg","tmdb":5268719},{"actor":"Rafa Neves","role":"James Vane","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/gjYqlkFJd3bH0ijUv2OnyBjAgHQ.jpg","tmdb":4639617},{"actor":"Pedro Ferreira","role":"Alan Campbell / Mephistopheles","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/4s6iPqmPh0BjCVFRkZycOHHZSQA.jpg","tmdb":5268722},{"actor":"Caio Mutai","role":"Benjamin Jarman","photo":"https://image.tmdb.org/t